     <h1 class="title" title="Coorg Hill Station">Coorg</h1>
     <div class="entry-content">

<p>

<img src="https://storage.googleapis.com/createweb/INDIAHILLSTATION.INFO/images/south-india-hill-stations/coorg-hill-station.jpg" title="Coorg hill station" alt="Coorg hill station, hill stations in india, south india hill stations, Coorg" style="width:200px;height:150px" class="thumb alignright"/>


<b>Location:</b> Western Ghats, Karnataka<br />
<b>Area:</b> 16sq.Kms<br />
<b>Significance:</b> Scotland of India<br />
<b>Altitude:</b> 1525m above sea level.<br />
<b>Climate:</b> Summer 27&#176;C to 30&#176;C, Winter 19&#176;C to 24&#176;C.<br />
<b>Best Time to Visit:</b> October to April.</p>
<p>It is a popular <b>hill station in Karnataka</b>. Coorg is popular as <b>Scotland of India</b>. <b>Foggy hills</b>, striped green forest, plantations of tea and coffee extends to the eyes can see, orange, beat the streets make it an <b>unforgettable holiday destination</b>. I want to share important information with you. You should be grateful to Coorg for his contribution to the security of our borders.</p>




